  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/831\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/831</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/831\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=831\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/831\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/831\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>선생님 자료를 보고 증발 확산 애니메이션 만들기를 진행했습니다.</p><p>아이들이 생각보다 잘 만들었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수업은 총 2시간으로 진행했고, 활동이 일찍 끝난 친구들은 비상 교과서 p135쪽 전자코 만들기 활동을 진행했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 이비스페인트 사용법 안내</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8VygfhFlCo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8VygfhFlCo</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8VygfhFlCo\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/2KUcI/hyVZl7yQRo/qDsjLgahUzdkt6KVtKCWKk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_8VygfhFlCo\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 증발 또는 확산 예시 애니메이션으로 만들기(빨리 만든 학생들은 영상 2개 만들기)</p><p>*아이들이 향수 예시를 많이 사용하여 나중에는 향수 말고 다른 예시로 해보라고 안내했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 애니메이션 2개를 만든 후에도 시간이 남으면 전자코 만들기 활동</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfirujfp4kcn2j1drues4bwr@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvfirujfp4kcn2j1drues4bwr/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33272049840&amp;signature=VDMWRIx%2BkxTzsihBb6kyWmO7N6k%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfirujfp4kcn2j1drues4bwr?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZmlydWpmcDRrY24yajFkcnVlczRid3IiLCJ0aWQiOiI1YzI0MzMxMS1jYWY4LTRhZjMtYjgzYi1jN2Q4ZDIwNzZhZDAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQwMzd9.0gpY0WOOmbU7-wUa_mWt4gzp-TP2nG7PBAtxQTkCzvzS7l81gv8Qi2Np9OfmVe3b5IVtKxVDw5wOJaAMJDuB7Q&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvjtuahy6g1khg721y8q6l1qt@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-th